#: src/review_panel.rs
msgctxt "AddSupportsDialog"
msgid "One island has no support."
msgid_plural "{n} islands have no support."
msgstr[0] "Una isla no tiene soporte."
msgstr[1] "{n} islas no tienen soporte."

#: src/review_panel.rs
msgctxt "AddSupportsDialog"
msgid ""
"Add supports? The tips go under them, the plate is sliced again, and one Undo "
"takes it all back."
msgstr ""
"¿Agregar soportes? Las puntas van debajo, se vuelve a laminar y un solo "
"Deshacer revierte todo."

#: src/review_panel.rs
msgctxt "Review"
msgid "The supports are in: no island is left without one."
msgstr "Los soportes están puestos: no queda ninguna isla sin soporte."

#: src/review_panel.rs
msgctxt "Review"
msgid "The supports are in. One island is still without one; its row says why."
msgid_plural ""
"The supports are in. {n} islands are still without one; their rows say why."
msgstr[0] ""
"Los soportes están puestos. Una isla sigue sin soporte; su fila dice por qué."
msgstr[1] ""
"Los soportes están puestos. {n} islas siguen sin soporte; sus filas dicen por "
"qué."

#: src/review_panel.rs
msgctxt "Review"
msgid "Adding supports was cancelled; nothing was changed."
msgstr "Se canceló agregar soportes; no se cambió nada."

#: src/review_panel.rs
msgctxt "Review"
msgid "Adding supports was undone before it was done; nothing was changed."
msgstr "Se deshizo agregar soportes antes de terminar; no se cambió nada."

#: src/review_panel.rs
msgctxt "Review"
msgid "The scene changed while the supports were added; nothing was changed."
msgstr "La escena cambió mientras se agregaban los soportes; no se cambió nada."

#: src/review_panel.rs
msgctxt "Review"
msgid ""
"It never gets as wide as the smallest tip before it joins the rest, so it is "
"too small for one. Place one by hand in the Supports tab, or leave it."
msgstr ""
"Nunca llega al ancho de la punta más chica antes de unirse al resto, así que "
"es demasiado chica para una. Poné una a mano en la pestaña Soportes, o dejala."

msgctxt "AddSupportsDialog"
msgid "One region grows at once."
msgid_plural "{n} regions grow at once."
msgstr[0] "Una región crece de golpe."
msgstr[1] "{n} regiones crecen de golpe."

msgctxt "Review"
msgid ""
"It has {} of the {} tips it wants. No support could be added for the rest: "
"{}. Try a point nearby with the Add tool in the Supports tab."
msgstr ""
"Tiene {} de las {} puntas que pide. No se pudo agregar soporte para el resto: "
"{}. Probá un punto cercano con la herramienta Agregar de la pestaña Soportes."

msgctxt "Review"
msgid ""
"It has {} of the {} tips it wants: no more fit on what it gained. Place them "
"by hand in the Supports tab, or leave it."
msgstr ""
"Tiene {} de las {} puntas que pide: no entran más en lo que ganó. Ponelas a "
"mano en la pestaña Soportes, o dejala."

msgctxt "DfSupportDialog"
msgid "The scene rejected the new supports; nothing was changed."
msgstr "La escena rechazó los soportes nuevos; no cambió nada."

msgctxt "Review"
msgid ""
"A tip ends {} layers below this island and does not reach it, so it holds "
"nothing. Place one that reaches it, or leave it."
msgstr ""
"Una punta termina {} capas debajo de esta isla y no llega, así que no sostiene "
"nada. Poné una que llegue, o dejala."

msgctxt "Review"
msgid "A tip ends {} layers below it."
msgstr "Una punta termina {} capas debajo."

#: src/presupported_import.rs
msgctxt "SeparateSupportsDialog"
msgid "This file has supports"
msgstr "Este archivo trae soportes"

#: src/presupported_import.rs
msgctxt "SeparateSupportsDialog"
msgid "1 model, {n} support and a raft. Separate them? The supports go to an object of their own: Breadslicer does not support them again, and they move with the model."
msgid_plural "1 model, {n} supports and a raft. Separate them? The supports go to an object of their own: Breadslicer does not support them again, and they move with the model."
msgstr[0] "1 modelo, {n} soporte y una balsa. ¿Separarlos? Los soportes pasan a un objeto propio: Breadslicer no les pone soportes de nuevo y se mueven con el modelo."
msgstr[1] "1 modelo, {n} soportes y una balsa. ¿Separarlos? Los soportes pasan a un objeto propio: Breadslicer no les pone soportes de nuevo y se mueven con el modelo."

#: src/presupported_import.rs
msgctxt "SeparateSupportsDialog"
msgid "1 model and {n} support. Separate them? The supports go to an object of their own: Breadslicer does not support them again, and they move with the model."
msgid_plural "1 model and {n} supports. Separate them? The supports go to an object of their own: Breadslicer does not support them again, and they move with the model."
msgstr[0] "1 modelo y {n} soporte. ¿Separarlos? Los soportes pasan a un objeto propio: Breadslicer no les pone soportes de nuevo y se mueven con el modelo."
msgstr[1] "1 modelo y {n} soportes. ¿Separarlos? Los soportes pasan a un objeto propio: Breadslicer no les pone soportes de nuevo y se mueven con el modelo."

#: src/presupported_import.rs
msgctxt "SeparateSupportsDialog"
msgid "Supports fused into the model"
msgstr "Soportes fundidos con el modelo"

#: src/presupported_import.rs
msgctxt "SeparateSupportsDialog"
msgid "The supports of this file are fused with the model and cannot be separated. Breadslicer takes the whole file as one model."
msgstr "Los soportes de este archivo están fundidos con el modelo y no se pueden separar. Breadslicer toma todo el archivo como un solo modelo."

#: src/presupported_import.rs
msgctxt "SeparateSupportsDialog"
msgid "Breadslicer already made supports for this object, so its imported supports are not separated. Undo the supports made here to separate them."
msgstr "Breadslicer ya le hizo soportes a este objeto, así que sus soportes importados no se separan. Deshacé los soportes hechos acá para separarlos."

#: src/presupported_import.rs
msgctxt "SeparateSupportsDialog"
msgid "Separated: the model and its imported supports."
msgstr "Separados: el modelo y sus soportes importados."

#: src/presupported_import.rs
msgctxt "SeparateSupportsDialog"
msgid "Imported supports removed; generating supports for the model."
msgstr "Soportes importados quitados; generando soportes para el modelo."

#: src/presupported_import.rs
msgctxt "SeparateSupportsDialog"
msgid "Imported supports removed."
msgstr "Soportes importados quitados."

#: ui/message-layer.slint
msgctxt "SeparateSupportsDialog"
msgid "Leave as is"
msgstr "Dejar como está"

#: ui/message-layer.slint
msgctxt "SeparateSupportsDialog"
msgid "Keep them"
msgstr "Conservarlos"

